WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:06.840
Queen Sareth:
Rejoice his shame remains
unknown...

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.967
Queen Sareth:
...that he had almost...

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:10.802
Queen Sareth:
...sat a throne.

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:13.263
I don't know that poem.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.265
It's about an uprising.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:27.319
Brother Day:
Over a hundred years ago...

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.447
Brother Day:
...Hari Seldon stood where you
are now.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:34.409
Brother Day:
He claimed he could establish a
foundation...

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:37.120
Brother Day:
...to read the future...

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:40.624
Brother Day:
...and shorten a coming age of
darkness.

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:43.669
Brother Dusk:
Can they read the future?

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:49.716
There are things happening here
that you don't understand.

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.052
It's time...

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:53.345
Hari Seldon:
...the empire...

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:54.680
Hari Seldon:
...had a reckoning.

00:01:03.814 --> 00:01:05.524
Hari Seldon:
All empires fall.

